        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Physics Worksheet</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n        background-color: #e0e0e0;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 40px;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .page-container {\n        background-color: #fff;\n        width: 800px;\n        padding: 60px 80px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        position: relative;\n        border: 1px solid #333;\n        box-shadow: 5px 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        color: #000;\n    }\n    .pin-placeholder {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 20px;\n        left: 20px;\n        width: 30px;\n        height: 40px;\n        border: 1px dashed #999;\n        background-color: #fafafa;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: #666;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n    .folded-corner {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        right: 0;\n        width: 0;\n        height: 0;\n        border-style: solid;\n        border-width: 0 50px 50px 0;\n        border-color: transparent #e0e0e0 transparent transparent;\n    }\n    .folded-corner::after {\n        content: \"\";\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        right: -50px;\n        width: 0;\n        height: 0;\n        border-style: solid;\n        border-width: 0 0 50px 50px;\n        border-color: transparent transparent #fff #fff;\n        box-shadow: -2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    }\n    .question {\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n    }\n    .q-text {\n        text-indent: -1.8em;\n        margin-left: 1.8em;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .options-inline {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        margin-left: 1.8em;\n        gap: 25px;\n    }\n    .options-grid-2x2 {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n        margin-left: 1.8em;\n        row-gap: 5px;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        border: 1px dashed #999;\n        background-color: #fafafa;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        color: #666;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        margin-left: 1.8em;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .footer {\n        position: relative;\n        margin-top: 60px;\n        height: 30px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .footer-center {\n        position: absolute;\n        left: 50%;\n        transform: translateX(-50%);\n    }\n    .footer-right {\n        position: absolute;\n        right: 0;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-container\">\n    <div class=\"pin-placeholder\">[Pin]</div>\n    <div class=\"folded-corner\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 120px;\">[Diagram: Pulley system with block A]</div>\n        <div class=\"options-inline\">\n            <span>A. F=90N; W=27J</span>\n            <span>B. F=60N; W=54J</span>\n            <span>C. F=30N; W=27J</span>\n            <span>D. F=60N; W=18J</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n        <div class=\"q-text\">7. 平直公路上的甲、乙两辆汽车，在相同牵引力作用下匀速行驶，如果在相同时间内通过的路程之比为3：2，则甲与乙（　　）</div>\n        <div class=\"options-grid-2x2\">\n            <div>A. 牵引力做功之比为2：3</div>\n            <div>B. 牵引力做功之比为3：2</div>\n            <div>C. 牵引力的功率之比为1：1</div>\n            <div>D. 汽车所受的阻力之比为3：2</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n        <div class=\"q-text\">8. 小丽用40N的水平推力将一个重90N的箱子水平推动了1m，所用时间2s；小宇又将这个箱子匀速提上了0.4m高的台阶，所用的时间1.5s。比较小丽、小宇所做的功$W_1$、$W_2$和做功的功率$P_1$、$P_2$之间大小的关系是（　　）</div>\n        <div class=\"options-grid-2x2\">\n            <div>A. $W_1 > W_2 \\quad P_1 < P_2$</div>\n            <div>B. $W_1 > W_2 \\quad P_1 > P_2$</div>\n            <div>C. $W_1 < W_2 \\quad P_1 < P_2$</div>\n            <div>D. $W_1 < W_2 \\quad P_1 > P_2$</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n        <div class=\"q-text\">9. 放在倾角为$\\alpha$斜面上的物体，对斜面的压力与物体重力的关系是$N=G \\cdot \\cos\\alpha$，而摩擦力与压力成正比。如图所示，将同一物体，分别用$F_1$、$F_2$的推力，沿接触面粗糙程度相同的AB、AC两斜面从底端用相同时间匀速推到斜面顶端，推力$F_1$、$F_2$所做的功分别为$W_1$、$W_2$，做功的功率分别是$P_1$、$P_2$，下列说法正确的是（　　）</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 100px;\">[Diagram: Triangle ABC with blocks on AB and AC]</div>\n        <div class=\"options-inline\">\n            <span>A. $W_1 = W_2$，$P_1 = P_2$</span>\n            <span>B. $W_1 > W_2$，$P_1 > P_2$</span>\n            <span>C. $W_1 < W_2$，$P_1 < P_2$</span>\n            <span>D. $W_1 > W_2$，$P_1 < P_2$</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n        <div class=\"q-text\">10. A、B两物体分别在水平拉力作用下都做匀速直线运动，如果B所受的拉力是A的3倍，A的运动速度是B的4倍，在相同的时间内，拉力对A、B两物体做功之比是（　　）</div>\n        <div class=\"options-inline\">\n            <span>A. 3：4</span>\n            <span>B. 8：3</span>\n            <span>C. 4：3</span>\n            <span>D. 24：1</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n        <div class=\"q-text\">11. 把一个重物以相同的速度沿AD、BD、CD三个光滑斜面匀速推向顶端，如图所示，则推力的功率是（　　）</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 120px;\">[Diagram: Triangle ACD with point B on AC, lines AD, BD, CD]</div>\n        <div class=\"options-inline\">\n            <span>A. 沿AD最大</span>\n            <span>B. 沿BD最大</span>\n            <span>C. 沿CD最大</span>\n            <span>D. 一样大</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n        <div class=\"q-text\">12. 用如图所示滑轮组，将质量为48kg的物体以0.3m/s的速度匀速提起，绳子自由端的拉力为200N；若用该滑轮组将重570N的物体匀速提升2m时，不计绳重、绳子的伸长和滑轮内部的摩擦，（g=10N/kg），则（　　）</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <span class=\"footer-center\">初中物理</span>\n        <span class=\"footer-right\">第 2 页</span>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
